{"id":"e04t4","name":"Courier Shift Hours","lang":"python","entry":"solution","params":["shifts"],"limit_s":4,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>Couriers declare their shifts in a planning tool. You are given <code>shifts</code>, a list of strings of the form <code>\"courier_id HH:MM-HH:MM\"</code> (for example <code>\"c7 08:00-12:30\"</code>). All shifts are in the same day.</p>\n<ul><li>A shift that ends at or before its start time goes past midnight: it ends at that time on the <b>next</b> day (for example <code>\"22:00-01:00\"</code> lasts 3 hours).</li><li>A courier can declare overlapping or touching shifts: time that is covered by several shifts is counted <b>once</b>.</li></ul>\n<p>Your task is to return, for each courier, a pair <code>[courier_id, worked]</code> where <code>worked</code> is the total time worked formatted as <code>\"HH:MM\"</code> (hours can be greater than 24). Sort by worked time, longest first, then by <code>courier_id</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>For <code>shifts = [\"c1 08:00-12:00\", \"c2 09:00-11:30\", \"c1 10:00-13:00\", \"c1 14:00-15:00\"]</code>, the output should be</p><pre class=\"exv\">[[\"c1\", \"06:00\"], [\"c2\", \"02:30\"]]</pre>\n<p><code>c1</code> works from <code>08:00</code> to <code>13:00</code> (the two first shifts overlap) and from <code>14:00</code> to <code>15:00</code>: 6 hours.</p><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 4 seconds (py3)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB<br><b>[input]</b> array.string shifts<br><b>[output]</b> array.array.string</div>","starter":"def solution(shifts):\n    # write your code here\n    return []\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["fusion d'intervalles","tri","parsing HH:MM","passage de minuit"],"minutes":20,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"shifts":["c1 08:00-12:00","c2 09:00-11:30","c1 10:00-13:00","c1 14:00-15:00"]},"expected":{"value":[["c1","06:00"],["c2","02:30"]]}},{"input":{"shifts":["k9 22:00-01:00","k9 00:30-02:00","a1 06:00-09:00","a1 09:00-10:00"]},"expected":{"value":[["k9","04:30"],["a1","04:00"]]}}],"hidden_n":9,"hidden":"","solution":""}